%% Purchase sequence (agent flow) — Sokoto Rainfall Cover
sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent
    participant SPA as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Wallet as MetaMask
    participant INS as WeatherIndexInsurance
    Agent->>SPA: selects farmer, crop, window, threshold, payout<br/>+ naira payment method & reference
    SPA->>INS: quotePremium(payout) on trusted RPC
    SPA->>INS: estimateGas(buyPolicy) on trusted RPC
    SPA->>Wallet: eth_chainId check → wallet_switchEthereumChain if needed
    SPA->>Wallet: buyPolicy(...) with explicit gasLimit and premium
    Wallet->>INS: signed transaction
    INS-->>INS: reserves payout, emits PolicyCreated
    INS-->>SPA: receipt (policyId, block)
    SPA->>API: POST /api/agent/sales (receipt)
    API->>INS: re-read policy, verify premium/payout/window
    API-->>SPA: receipt saved (or rejected)
    Note over SPA,API: farmer and admin notified in-app;<br/>SMS/Telegram via notifier
